  "honest_caveats": [
    "n=14 at 0-2.5yr for colorectal is very underpowered.",
    "The cycling CpG panel (20 CpGs) was derived from VAL-047 GSE51057 secretory context and may not be optimally selected for cycling architecture at the 450K array level.",
    "Zhao 2020 reports per-CpG d = +0.835 for colorectal directional score on this same cohort \u2014 the SIGNAL is present, but the architectural-variance metric on this specific panel does not capture it.",
    "GSE51057 (breast) and GSE51032 (CRC) are drawn from the same source population (EPIC-Italy), limiting truly independent replication.",
    "Results are retrospective. Prospective validation on an independent cohort with pre-specified CpG panels (or a dedicated capture panel) is required before clinical claims."
  ],
